00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:36,000
What happens when art meets trash?

3
00:33:45,000 --> 00:33:51,000
Maintenance Artist profiles pioneering public artist Mierle Laderman Ukeles —
the first artist-in-residence at NYC’s Department of Sanitation.

4
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Self, played by Mierle Laderman Ukeles.

5
00:56:15,000 --> 00:56:21,000
Maintenance Required is a 2025 romantic comedy film
directed and written by Lacey Uhlemeyer.

6
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
The film follows Charlie, who while reevaluating her all-female mechanic shop, confides
with Beau, an online confidant, who is actually a real-life business rival.

7
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
The film was released in the United States by Amazon MGM Studios as a
Amazon Prime Video original film on October 8, 2025.
